PRIVACY POLICY

Color Palette does not collect, store, or share any personal data.

The app does not ask for your name, email, or any personal information. It does not use analytics, tracking, or advertising tools. It does not send any information to us or to third parties.

All palettes and color codes you create are saved only on your device. If you delete the app, that data is deleted with it.

If you have any questions about this policy, contact us at ensarigizem1230@gmail.com.

